{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/814854-top-3-martial-arts-styles-and-spell-you-are-waiting-for","id":814854,"title":"Top 3 Martial Arts Styles and Spell you are waiting for?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-23T08:11:32-08:00","id":814854,"title":"Top 3 Martial Arts Styles and Spell you are waiting for?","content":"Since I finished reading 3rd ed I have been chomping at the bit for more! What are the Top three Martial Arts Styles and Top three Spells you just can't wait for? I know I have a player that wants Falling Blossoms Style now!<br /> <br /> And a side note, Dr. Professor Holden will we ever get say Swaying Grass Dance in Canon?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-23T09:08:30-08:00","id":814867,"title":"","content":"Throne Shadow and Violet Bier of Sorrows. Going to be waiting a while for those though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-23T09:13:39-08:00","id":814871,"title":"","content":"As far as spells go, I'm really curious to see how the other no-beating-around-the-bush-named Solar Circle spell, Total Annihilation, compares to Death Ray. Also, if Solar Sanctuary will still be a spell, likewise with Pressed Beyond the Veil of Time or whatever is the name of that spell that banishes a city.<br /> <br /> For Martial Arts, I don't really have a top 3. The immaculate styles are something of high interest to me, as well as any example of SMA so I at least have the basics on how they work in EX3 in case I want to convert others from previous editions or create my own.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-23T10:08:22-08:00","id":814894,"title":"","content":"Several that have already been mentioned, the Immaculate Styles and Throne Shadow in particular.<br /> <br /> I'm also eager to see some of the old Terrestrial Styles under the new MA paradigm. So far all of the ones we've seen were Celestial Styles in previous editions, with some Terrestrial keywords there to offer lower rungs of power. But I want to see how things like First Pulse and Five Dragon and White Veil get scaled up to be worthy fighting styles for Celestial Exalted.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Share your wonders in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop#post823884\" target=\"_blank\">The Artifact and Evocation Workshop</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1315-ferryman","name":"Ferryman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1315_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"960"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-23T10:17:45-08:00","id":814896,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ferryman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/814854-top-3-martial-arts-styles-and-spell-you-are-waiting-for?p=814894#post814894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm also eager to see some of the old Terrestrial Styles under the new MA paradigm. So far all of the ones we've seen were Celestial Styles in previous editions, with some Terrestrial keywords there to offer lower rungs of power. But I want to see how things like First Pulse and Five Dragon and White Veil get scaled up to be worthy fighting styles for Celestial Exalted.</div> </div> </div> </div>Golden Janissary especially interests me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-23T10:52:24-08:00","id":814924,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/814854-top-3-martial-arts-styles-and-spell-you-are-waiting-for?p=814867#post814867\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Throne Shadow and Violet Bier of Sorrows. Going to be waiting a while for those though.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sidereal style forever ! Also Sapphire Veils of Passion for bonding with your enemy on the battlefield :'D<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-23T10:56:06-08:00","id":814928,"title":"","content":"The Immaculate Styles for my Martial Arts. Since that's 5 styles, I wont' pick more.<br /> <br /> For Spells, I want to see the new crew balance Unity of the Closed Fist. So iconic, just hard to create. Also looking forward to Total Annihilation. And finally, I'm looking forward to brand new spells, that have never been done before. There's always favorites we want to see return, but I was the most excited that they created some NEW things and they are awesome. I want more new material for this edition.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-23T20:06:53-08:00","id":815200,"title":"","content":"Swaying Grass Dance is one I'm looking forward to. I'm also curious if Fivefold Shadow Hand can be turned into something workable or if it will just be forgotten. Yes, it's basically just a mashup of Naruto powers, but it had this funky progression through the tree that I liked. And, ok, I did like the powers.<br /> <br /> Spellwise, hmmm... I'm not sure I have a specific set of three, but I'd enjoy seeing more utility spells. Also some Other Element Dragon Claws or something. Soul Sword would be neat. Definitely more spells with odd quirks when you take them as your Control Spell.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-23T20:29:27-08:00","id":815206,"title":"","content":"crystal chameleon style","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1203-caladon","name":"Caladon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"142"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-23T20:36:18-08:00","id":815212,"title":"","content":"For Martial Arts (Ugh, my trash brain keeps typoing that as MARITAL Arts which is NOT what we need to talk about) I'm gonna echo some sentiments... I want to see Crystal Chameleon Style, I want to see what one of the SMAs looks like (Any style, really. Might even just start with the Prismatic Arrangement of Creation Style, I hear that one's kind of traditional)... And it can be Swaying Grass Dance, or it can be that idea-snowballed Dread Hurricane Style.<br /> <br /> Look, I've got a kicking character concept, one of my friends has a concept for a Terrestrial who uses kicks. Whatever, we just need a style that lets someone literally kick someone else's ass.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-23T20:48:01-08:00","id":815218,"title":"","content":"Yeah I want the Other Elemental Dragon Claws to eventually show up! Just like Centipede Style it was released in the old catalog. Speaking of which I think my three if I had my Druthers would be Celestial Monkey Style (Damn we need the animal styles they are your meat and potatoes for the fundamentals covering a broad range), Swaying Grass Dance, but if not then First Pulse instead as an example of a Terrestrial Martial Art Style converted to 3rd ed, and Golly I want Centipede to be brought back!<br /> <br /> And for Spells, one more Dragon Claw spell (Hell all of them if possible but at least one more), and I love summonings so one of the Minion of the Eyeless Face Spells, and hmmm how about that Lords of the Fallen Tower spell, that should be useful for major construction with the beef ups of 3rd ed. Simple spells like that Water from Stone and Food from the Aerial table would be interesting to see how they are spiffied.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-23T20:51:34-08:00","id":815220,"title":"","content":"And all the Dragon King Styles were hella cool, especial Eye of Heaven and the Black Water Style. Hell we need Eye of Heaven and Hungry Ghost just fill the Heart Ripping Fatality Triumvirate!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-23T20:51:51-08:00","id":815221,"title":"","content":"Martial Arts: First Pulse, Arms of the Unconquered Sun, Quicksilver Hand of Dreams<br /> <br /> Spell: The spell that summoned a huge cluster of wings with arms to carry things for you. Don't remember it's name. EDIT: <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Swift Spirit of Winged Transportation, I think.</span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>SWTOR Referal: <a href=\"http://www.swtor.com/r/JQ2nqy\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.swtor.com/r/JQ2nqy</a>","edited":{"userid":414,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/414-gallus","user":"Gallus","date":". 01-23-2016, 11:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/414-gallus","name":"Gallus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar414_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"886"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-23T21:14:51-08:00","id":815232,"title":"","content":"I'm looking forward to Monkey Style, White Veil Style, and Violet Bier of Sorrows Style.<br /> <br /> As for spells... ummm... Necromancy I guess?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/746-kunoichi","name":"Kunoichi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar746_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"348"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-23T21:22:41-08:00","id":815237,"title":"","content":"Throne Shadow, because it's the most Sidereal of all styles.<br /> <br /> Mantis, because I watched Marco Polo.<br /> <br /> Any Sidereal styles, just to see what they look like.<br /> <br /> As for spells... Banishment, because my sorcerer has it. Various utility spells. Disguise of the New Face because I want to see it nerfed.<br /> I'm actually more interested in new spells though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-23T21:40:11-08:00","id":815247,"title":"","content":"<b>Martial Arts</b><br /> Mantis, becuase I like more bread-and-butter kung fu and I want more of the animal styels about.<br /> <br /> Monkey, so that it is maybe handled in a way that is less overly odd and maybe not as potentially broken.<br /> <br /> Jade Mountain, with hopes it's less Earth Dragon light.<br /> <br /> <b>Spells</b><br /> The Violent Opening of Closed Portals for being thematic as hell.<br /> <br /> Virtueous Guardian of Flame for it's cool aesthetics and effects.<br /> <br /> Necromancy really in general.<br /> <br /> And stuff.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-23T23:21:25-08:00","id":815280,"title":"","content":"Oh, speaking of Martial Arts styles... Okay, it was removed from the core's final edition, but in the leak we had a Shikari of each of the Five Dragon Styles. Not just Air, Earth, and Fire.<br /> <br /> The Wood Dragon Stylist used a staff.<br /> <br /> Yeah, we FINALLY have a style that seems to use probably one of the most iconic martial arts weapons in fiction (staffs are pretty Kung Fu) besides Mantis's basic &quot;Any Martial Art Weapon&quot;. I know there are styles that use a Sectional Staff like Snake, but that doesn't seem to quite fit.<br /> <br /> (Okay, yeah, and White Reaper can use a staff, but that's added in as a bit of an afterthought. &quot;Yeah, if you don't want to butcher people, you can use a staff&quot;)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-23T23:46:42-08:00","id":815286,"title":"","content":"Indeed, and wielding a wooden staff does seem pretty iconic for a Wood Immaculate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T00:00:46-08:00","id":815290,"title":"","content":"Heaven's Ladder, or whatever that beating-people-up-with-a-ladder style was called. I heard it was going to be in the 3e core, but it's not there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/797631-why-craft-sucks-how-i-fixed-it\" target=\"_blank\">EX3 Craft Rewrite</a><br /> <br /> Sanctaphrax is not a person<br /> -Chejop Kejak","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1154-sanctaphrax","name":"Sanctaphrax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1154_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T00:23:42-08:00","id":815293,"title":"","content":"They decided they had too many wacky styles (Black Claw, Dreaming Pearl, Nightingale, etc) in the Core and not enough standard stuff, so they replaced it. Possibly with Steel Razor? Anyway, I imagine it will come back.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T00:49:25-08:00","id":815298,"title":"","content":"Martial Arts: Yeah....Immaculate Styles. I'm both dreading and hoping they have the Mastery keyword. It could be so cool, but also kind of douchy, but if they did you could be a Solar with all five dragon styles and basically be the avatar of awesomeness with freaking Solar tier Fire/Air/Water/Earth/Wood Dragon charms.<br /> <br /> Spells: This is a tough one, since my first third ed character is probably going to be a sorcerer. I'll go for all Emerald circle ones here, since it's a long time from session one until I'll get to see second or third circle ones. Disguise of the New Face, Flight of Seperation and maybe Impenetrable Sphere of Water? It's so hard to pick though, I want them all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T00:55:18-08:00","id":815299,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/814854-top-3-martial-arts-styles-and-spell-you-are-waiting-for?p=815280#post815280\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh, speaking of Martial Arts styles... Okay, it was removed from the core's final edition, but in the leak we had a Shikari of each of the Five Dragon Styles. Not just Air, Earth, and Fire.<br /> <br /> The Wood Dragon Stylist used a staff.<br /> <br /> Yeah, we FINALLY have a style that seems to use probably one of the most iconic martial arts weapons in fiction (staffs are pretty Kung Fu) besides Mantis's basic &quot;Any Martial Art Weapon&quot;. I know there are styles that use a Sectional Staff like Snake, but that doesn't seem to quite fit.<br /> <br /> (Okay, yeah, and White Reaper can use a staff, but that's added in as a bit of an afterthought. &quot;Yeah, if you don't want to butcher people, you can use a staff&quot;)</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, that bugged me for the longest time that only Citrine Poxes and Monkey, by technicality no less, could wield staves. Staves are a super staple of martial arts and monks. Why the balls wasn't Monkey style a staff wielding style? I really hope Wood Dragon keeps the staff as it's signature weapon when they get finally.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T02:08:14-08:00","id":815318,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/814854-top-3-martial-arts-styles-and-spell-you-are-waiting-for?p=815220#post815220\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And all the Dragon King Styles were hella cool, especial Eye of Heaven and the Black Water Style. Hell we need Eye of Heaven and Hungry Ghost just fill the Heart Ripping Fatality Triumvirate!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> A Gift courtesy of Lanaya!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1NK47sNjn5B6CxXTKwwhhuetBFGrIvn_h3ikpDdrGjQw/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1NK47sNjn5B6CxXTKwwhhuetBFGrIvn_h3ikpDdrGjQw/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1NK47sNjn5B6CxXTKwwhhuetBFGrIvn_h3ikpDdrGjQw/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://docs.google.com/document/d/1NK47sNjn5B6CxXTKwwhhuetBFGrIvn_h3ikpDdrGjQw/edit?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Exalted: Princes of the Universe<br /> A Third Edition Exalted Podcast<br /> <b><u><a href=\"http://atrusilk.podbean.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://atrusilk.podbean.com/</a></u></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8769-tavelgorge","name":"TavelGorge","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8769_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"498"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T03:27:07-08:00","id":815341,"title":"","content":"I think I'm possibly the outlier here, because I want to see the weird Terrestrial Martial Arts from Scroll of the Monk pushed to be even with Puissant Celestial Styles, can't wait!<br /> <br /> Martial Arts:<br /> <br /> Orgiastic Fugitive Style: Drunken Martial Arts needs to make a return.<br /> <br /> Terrible-Ascent Driven Beast Style: Just the name man, this needs to be some far-eastern Jungle Folk death from above style.<br /> <br /> And I'm curious about the Immaculate Styles, of course.<br /> <br /> prototype00<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"964"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T03:53:26-08:00","id":815345,"title":"","content":"I want to see the return of Even Blade and Crimson Pentacle Blade. Plus of course any and all Sidereal Styles.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My attempt at a <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/15dK8fZaL-Kn-yGKxW6VRg_z6aF27FqbIf-t8ZEXmMC4/edit?pref=2&amp;pli=1#\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal 3e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8793-grifftofer","name":"Grifftofer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8793_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T07:26:23-08:00","id":815431,"title":"","content":"Crystal Chameleon style because disco ninja be awesome as fuck.<br /> <br /> Laughing Wounds Style because i feel like we're really missing a super-brutal style focused on bringing the pain.<br /> <br /> Orgiastic Fugitive Style because how the shit do we not have a drunken master style?<br /> <br /> <br /> With sorcery... I kind of want to be surprised. The weirder the spell, the better.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/903-cheshire-cat","name":"Cheshire Cat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar903_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T07:42:35-08:00","id":815440,"title":"","content":"Air, Water and Wood Dragon Styles.<br /> <br /> And Sworn Brotherhoods Oath.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/697-arteliex","name":"Arteliex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar697_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"591"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T07:52:18-08:00","id":815446,"title":"","content":"Swaying Grass Dance is very likely to show up in Ex3, because all the styles Holden wrote are super easy to convert over.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/527-robert-vance","name":"Robert Vance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar527_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T07:59:02-08:00","id":815453,"title":"","content":"Since we already have Death Ray as the WoMD spell I wonder if there is a need for a Total Annihilation's write-up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T09:48:00-08:00","id":815528,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/814854-top-3-martial-arts-styles-and-spell-you-are-waiting-for?p=815453#post815453\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since we already have Death Ray as the WoMD spell I wonder if there is a need for a Total Annihilation's write-up.</div> </div> </div> </div>There is ALWAYS a need for another Kill Everything spell. This edition has lots of methods of being peaceful and negotiatable. Let me just kill all humans.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com/736x/a0/c1/67/a0c167e62232d1955a3a0daf2e159683.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T10:16:15-08:00","id":815546,"title":"","content":"Teamwork-based styles, disco ball style, and another 'good to be a baddie' style. Something that helps you 'shoot through (hostage)' or kill with a distinct calling card to lure the heroes to your deathtrap.<br /> <br /> Spellwise, we have go-faster, shooty, and defendy spells. Corrupted words is the most socially spell I remember, so I'd want some more of those translated. After that, some of the most 'exalted-ish'. I want my Minions of the Eyeless Face, my &quot;Only a Solar could curse like that&quot; curses, an &quot;I want to be showered with rose petals whenever I speak&quot;, and &quot;This manse/army blocks my view. I Solar-spell it to the other side of my lawn.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2678-spoonr","name":"SpoonR","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2678_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T10:17:53-08:00","id":815549,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>prototype00</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/814854-top-3-martial-arts-styles-and-spell-you-are-waiting-for?p=815341#post815341\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Orgiastic Fugitive Style: Drunken Martial Arts needs to make a return.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cheshire Cat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/814854-top-3-martial-arts-styles-and-spell-you-are-waiting-for?p=815431#post815431\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Orgiastic Fugitive Style because how the shit do we not have a drunken master style?</div> </div> </div> </div>Until it returns officially, may I direct your attention to the following <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/761356-orgiastic-fugitive-style-3e\">link</a>. Also I think someone's done an attempt at Laughing Wounds Style, can't find the link just now, sadly.<br /> <br /> I'd like to ditto with regards to Swaying Grass Style, although I might just see what might be necessary to convert it over...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11006-bowerbird","name":"Bowerbird","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11006_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T10:20:08-08:00","id":815551,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/814854-top-3-martial-arts-styles-and-spell-you-are-waiting-for?p=815298#post815298\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Martial Arts: Yeah....Immaculate Styles. I'm both dreading and hoping they have the Mastery keyword. It could be so cool, but also kind of douchy, but if they did you could be a Solar with all five dragon styles and basically be the avatar of awesomeness with freaking Solar tier Fire/Air/Water/Earth/Wood Dragon charms.</div> </div> </div> </div>I truly hope that if it does have the Mastery keyword, they'll have a special exception to let DBs use it. Non-Solar Celestials should be the ones stuck without (and really, Solars too, but I don't see that happening for the do-everything-better-than-the-specialists splat).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T10:24:34-08:00","id":815556,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WarDragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/814854-top-3-martial-arts-styles-and-spell-you-are-waiting-for?p=815551#post815551\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I truly hope that if it does have the Mastery keyword, they'll have a special exception to let DBs use it. Non-Solar Celestials should be the ones stuck without (and really, Solars too, but I don't see that happening for the do-everything-better-than-the-specialists splat).</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Well it was said they would be a type of martial art that has advantages to Terrestrial because they were built for them, so maybe Terrestrial Keyword works differently for it.<br /> <br /> <br /> Also Infernal Monster Style would be neat!<br /> <br /> Solars can't build on Martial arts Charms but Perhaps Sidereals can and maybe infernals... maybe not...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T10:41:14-08:00","id":815569,"title":"","content":"I believe it was stated (I have no quote, sorry) that the DBs would have some ability to ascend beyond the Terrestrial keyword, likely through Immaculate training. I suspect this wouldn't give them any Mastery keywords, but would take them beyond the restrictions of Terrestrial keyword to be equal to other Celestials with martial arts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T10:42:10-08:00","id":815571,"title":"","content":"<b>Martial Arts:</b> Throne Shadow (though I think it should be Sidereal Brawl), Orgiastic Fugitive, and Swaying Grass Dance.<br /> <br /> <b>Spells:</b> Flight of Separation, and I guess that's it?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/814854-top-3-martial-arts-styles-and-spell-you-are-waiting-for?p=815212#post815212\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Ugh, my trash brain keeps typoing that as MARITAL Arts which is NOT what we need to talk about)</div> </div> </div> </div>It's totally what we need to talk about. Magnolia Knives of Matrimony Style is boss.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T12:57:50-08:00","id":815641,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/814854-top-3-martial-arts-styles-and-spell-you-are-waiting-for?p=815556#post815556\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well it was said they would be a type of martial art that has advantages to Terrestrial because they were built for them, so maybe Terrestrial Keyword works differently for it.</div> </div> </div> </div>I had this thought too. Rather than &quot;Terrestrials, here's how it's not as good for you&quot; it's &quot;Terrestrials... Instead this works BETTER for you! Suck it, Solars!&quot; Which, y'know, I'm okay with.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Also Infernal Monster Style would be neat! </div> </div> </div>That'll probably just be Infernal Brawl, since Infernals are going to Ability-based charms.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T14:50:22-08:00","id":815698,"title":"","content":"These are all for the game we're going to be converting from 2E, I don't have anything specific for the 3E game I'm starting.<br /> Martial Arts: <ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Mantis Style, so my friend playing the wise Dawn sifu has the style they've mastered.</li> <li>Whatever the Terrestrial style was they had started on next, can't remember what it was. (Maybe Golden Janissary?)</li> </ol><br /> Our Night had started with Ebon Shadow, so no problem there. My geomancy-oriented Twilight used a mixture of Conviction and Solar Hero (with Resistance backup), but I'll probably be content with just the new Brawl charms. In 3E, I might go for Jade Mountain, but his fighting style isn't a core issue for the character; if it were an option, I might also be interested in Prismatic Arrangement of Creation simply because it has some geomantic tones.<br /> <br /> Previously, my character did not have Sorcery, but with the new sorcerous workings, I'm very much planning to take it.<br /> Spells: <ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Raising the Earth's Bones, since it makes sense for an ex-Lookshyan combat engineer to have been taught this.</li> <li>Raise the Puissant Sanctum. For those situations when the demesne is too far away to ship all my workers there.</li> </ol><br /> No real idea for a third spell, but with the new system and a decent spell list, I'd certainly be more on the lookout for good situations to learn new spells. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1361-amoeba","name":"Amoeba","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1361_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T15:13:22-08:00","id":815712,"title":"","content":"STYLES: Orgiastic Fugitive Style and not White Veil Style. I've always wanted those style to have the same firepower as celestial styles.<br /> <br /> Spells: Shattering Void Mirror or necromancy in general.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T15:30:42-08:00","id":815718,"title":"","content":"[QUOTE=Eldagusto;n815556Well it was said they would be a type of martial art that has advantages to Terrestrial because they were built for them, so maybe Terrestrial Keyword works differently for it.[/QUOTE]<br /> It could also be something about the way they interact with native DB charms gives them a special synergy for DBs.. You can see a similar effect in some of the existing Martial Arts, where various MA charms are substantially stronger for Solars not because of the Mastery keyword, but because certain native charms make them substantially cheaper and/or stronger.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10881-anasurimbor","name":"Anasurimbor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"363"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T15:44:25-08:00","id":815732,"title":"","content":"Martial Arts: Crystal Chameleon Style, because everybody needs more disco ninjas in their lives.<br /> White Veil Style and Citrine Pox of Contagion Style, and I want the combo that lets you steal peoples body parts and organs without them noticing to still work.<br /> <br /> As far as spells<br /> Links Born of Tumult is one of a coolest most evocative spells out there.<br /> Birth of Sanity's Sorrow seems an obvious choice.<br /> Black Faith, I always liked too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","name":"Hark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar151_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"932"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T19:12:34-08:00","id":815817,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert Vance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/814854-top-3-martial-arts-styles-and-spell-you-are-waiting-for?p=815446#post815446\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Swaying Grass Dance is very likely to show up in Ex3, because all the styles Holden wrote are super easy to convert over.</div> </div> </div> </div>HOLDEN AND VANCE, FIGHT ME IRL<br /> <br /> but for, y'know, research purposes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new\"><a href=\"https://jamesmendezhodes.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Mendez</span></a></span></div> <span style=\"font-family:courier new\"><b>Currently Developing</b> you know I should probably stop updating this field, I keep accidentally announcing things early<br /> <b>Crowdfund Me </b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mndz\" target=\"_blank\">via Patreon</a>: essays about race, religion, and culture in gaming</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8310-lula","name":"Lula","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8310_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T20:39:07-08:00","id":815862,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/814854-top-3-martial-arts-styles-and-spell-you-are-waiting-for?p=815641#post815641\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I had this thought too. Rather than &quot;Terrestrials, here's how it's not as good for you&quot; it's &quot;Terrestrials... Instead this works BETTER for you! Suck it, Solars!&quot; Which, y'know, I'm okay with.</div> </div> </div> </div>The problems with that are it doesn't make any sense, both mechanically and fluff wise. Solars/Abyssals/Sidereals are the best at martial arts, it wouldn't make sense for them to be even AS good as a DB at their elemental styles. Mechanically speaking, if you had a martial art that was worse for Solars than the DB version, then either the DB version is super overpowered or the Solar version is ridiculously underpowered to the point of being useless. Plus then my Solar immaculate grandmaster concept really sucks compared to the rest of the party.<br /> <br /> The only reason not to have it is because people playing DBs wouldn't feel like they were getting the most out of their charms, but that goes for any martial-arts based terrestrial.<br /> <br /> <br /> I'm also interested in Flight of Seperation and how that spell's timing is going to work. Do you have to gather motes for it? Maybe it has a low cost and you have to desperately try to do it in one turn? Like you can reflexively gather for it, but if it doesn't work the motes are lost?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T20:47:42-08:00","id":815866,"title":"","content":"Havne't read previous stufff yet<br /> <br /> Path of the artbiter<br /> golden exhaulation<br /> night breeze (this is the throwing dart one yes?)<br /> no real order there except arbiter first.<br /> <br /> spell wise.. guilitone","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1080-zwordsman","name":"zwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T21:11:48-08:00","id":815884,"title":"","content":"Violet Bier of Sorrows Style, Total Annihilation, Charcoal March of Spiders Style.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/800-fenrir666","name":"Fenrir666","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"300"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-25T00:10:59-08:00","id":815935,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/814854-top-3-martial-arts-styles-and-spell-you-are-waiting-for?p=815862#post815862\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The only reason not to have it is because people playing DBs wouldn't feel like they were getting the most out of their charms, but that goes for any martial-arts based terrestrial.</div> </div> </div> </div>I didn't make any mention of the Mastery concepts being crippled. I don't know, I just agree that there should be SOME kind of extra bang for the buck with the Terrestrials and the Dragon Styles. I mean, a Solar being just as good at Fire Dragon Style as a Fire Monk, sure, but it rubs me the wrong way if a Lunar or Alchemical could get more umph out of the Dragon Styles than the DBs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-25T00:39:12-08:00","id":815942,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/814854-top-3-martial-arts-styles-and-spell-you-are-waiting-for?p=815935#post815935\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I didn't make any mention of the Mastery concepts being crippled. I don't know, I just agree that there should be SOME kind of extra bang for the buck with the Terrestrials and the Dragon Styles. I mean, a Solar being just as good at Fire Dragon Style as a Fire Monk, sure, but it rubs me the wrong way if a Lunar or Alchemical could get more umph out of the Dragon Styles than the DBs.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, well in the core it says that certain immaculate masters can overcome the limitations of the terrestrial keyword, so in some way they'll be able to unlock the abilities that Lunars have when they use them. It will probably be really difficult though, maybe requiring complete mastery over the style, and then with another charm purchase it removes the terrestrial keyword for jaunt that style or something?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-25T03:31:00-08:00","id":815996,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/814854-top-3-martial-arts-styles-and-spell-you-are-waiting-for?p=815942#post815942\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh, well in the core it says that certain immaculate masters can overcome the limitations of the terrestrial keyword, so in some way they'll be able to unlock the abilities that Lunars have when they use them. It will probably be really difficult though, maybe requiring complete mastery over the style, and then with another charm purchase it removes the terrestrial keyword for jaunt that style or something?</div> </div> </div> </div>That was my original thought, a while ago, when I first found out that the Terrestrial keyword was a thing.<br /> <br /> Like, learn a certain number of MA charms from a Style, buy a Merit (probably like a 2-dot Merit per style, maybe more) and boom, the Terrestrial gets to ignore the Terrestrial keyword for that particular style.<br /> <br /> Now I'm wondering if this can be applied to NON-Immaculate styles. A Terrestrial who wanders through the Southern deserts for ten years, righting wrongs and meditating upon the purifying flame, and walks out ignoring the Terrestrial keyword of the Righteous Devil Style.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-25T04:57:42-08:00","id":816022,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hark</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/814854-top-3-martial-arts-styles-and-spell-you-are-waiting-for?p=815732#post815732\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Black Faith, I always liked too.</div> </div> </div> </div>You're <i>trying</i> to get a rise out of me, aren't you? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-25T06:04:51-08:00","id":816041,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/814854-top-3-martial-arts-styles-and-spell-you-are-waiting-for?p=816022#post816022\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You're <i>trying</i> to get a rise out of me, aren't you? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Wait, is there an objection to Black Faith? <br /> <br /> Unless it's a teleportation is bad argument, then I don't care.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","name":"Hark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar151_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"932"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-25T06:15:11-08:00","id":816045,"title":"","content":"MA:<br /> Crystal Chameleon<br /> Golden Janissary<br /> Hungry Ghost<br /> <br /> Spells:<br /> Violent Opening of Closed Portals<br /> Total Annihilation<br /> That spell that summoned a leaf-boat - not everything in creation should be about killing or being alien, sometimes I want to seduce someone (in order to facilitate the killing or alien things but that's not the point)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Useless-Post Prana<br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Cost: 2</span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">m; </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mins: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Linguistics 1, Essence 1 </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Type: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Simple</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Keywords: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mute</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Duration: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Instant</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Prerequisite Charms: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Ten-Characters Methodology</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2589-magnum-opus","name":"Magnum Opus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2589_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"821"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-25T07:28:55-08:00","id":816087,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/814854-top-3-martial-arts-styles-and-spell-you-are-waiting-for?p=815641#post815641\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I had this thought too. Rather than &quot;Terrestrials, here's how it's not as good for you&quot; it's &quot;Terrestrials... Instead this works BETTER for you! Suck it, Solars!&quot; Which, y'know, I'm okay with.</div> </div> </div> </div>Interesting idea, but I'd wager that with access to supernatural martial arts locked away from lower tier practitioners entirely, the Dragon Styles will just largely lack the keywords that only allow Celestial benefits. It's not in-theme to disallow a Celestial from something that a Terrestrial could do with the same resources.* I'd wager that unless we are going to see a dramatic shift in how Exalted works, Terrestrials will never really equal exp equivalent Celestials.<br /> <br /> *Caveat: Unless it is in-theme for the Terrestrial. My first thought would be Martial Arts Charms that allow Dragonblooded to pool their strengths together.**<br /> <br /> **Likewise, I'd subtly suggest that the writers for the new edition draw Terrestrial inspiration from the following Super Sentai series: Boukenger, Gekiranger, Shinkenger. Relatively recent series, with emphasis on devices created by lost civilizations, strange inimitable supernatural martial arts, and techniques/traditions/equipment passed down along bloodlines. In that order.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2586-beowulf89","user":"Beowulf89","date":". 01-25-2016, 10:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2586-beowulf89","name":"Beowulf89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-25T07:49:08-08:00","id":816103,"title":"","content":"I hope Wind-Cutting Blade, Graceful Hummingbird, and Coils of Typhon become canon in Ex3.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-25T12:45:34-08:00","id":816355,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lula</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/814854-top-3-martial-arts-styles-and-spell-you-are-waiting-for?p=815817#post815817\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">HOLDEN AND VANCE, FIGHT ME IRL<br /> <br /> but for, y'know, research purposes.</div> </div> </div> </div>For those of you who don't know him, forum user Lula was my Dude for research on real-life martial arts when writing styles for Ex3.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/527-robert-vance","name":"Robert Vance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar527_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-25T13:20:12-08:00","id":816383,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caladon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/814854-top-3-martial-arts-styles-and-spell-you-are-waiting-for?p=815206#post815206\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">crystal chameleon style</div> </div> </div> </div>I totally forgot that one. Yes, I want that one back too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-25T13:25:40-08:00","id":816386,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert Vance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/814854-top-3-martial-arts-styles-and-spell-you-are-waiting-for?p=816355#post816355\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For those of you who don't know him, forum user Lula was my Dude for research on real-life martial arts when writing styles for Ex3.</div> </div> </div> </div>Out of curiosity, are we likely to see any MA styles beyond the Immaculate Styles in the DB book?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-25T13:51:29-08:00","id":816408,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/814854-top-3-martial-arts-styles-and-spell-you-are-waiting-for?p=815862#post815862\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The problems with that are it doesn't make any sense, both mechanically and fluff wise. Solars/Abyssals/Sidereals are the best at martial arts, it wouldn't make sense for them to be even AS good as a DB at their elemental styles. Mechanically speaking, if you had a martial art that was worse for Solars than the DB version, then either the DB version is super overpowered or the Solar version is ridiculously underpowered to the point of being useless. Plus then my Solar immaculate grandmaster concept really sucks compared to the rest of the party.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think that's inconsistent at all, if there are styles designed to be used with elementally-aspected Essence, which are in fact <i>optimized </i>for use by that kind of Exalt. <br /> <br /> I also don't understand why it's so horrible that in one tiny little area, DBs might be better at a lousy five MA styles <i>in toto</i>, the five styles, I might add, which might have helped facilitate their overthrow of the Solars to begin with? That's hardly damaging the overall Solar niche.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Chicanery-No: If a player uses this Charm in an abusive or exploitative manner, the ST may punch him right in the goddamn face.&quot; --TheDementedOne<br /> <br /> &quot;Happiness is <i>very</i> brittle and short-lived in the Exalted community, because <i>ressentiment</i> is our cultural touchstone.&quot; --Gayo","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3420-zelbinnean","name":"Zelbinnean","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5884"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-25T14:33:35-08:00","id":816431,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/814854-top-3-martial-arts-styles-and-spell-you-are-waiting-for?p=816386#post816386\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Out of curiosity, are we likely to see any MA styles beyond the Immaculate Styles in the DB book?</div> </div> </div> </div>I would imagine Five Dragons Style at least, though I guess that counts as an Immaculate Style as it is Kosher.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-25T14:47:17-08:00","id":816440,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zelbinnean</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/814854-top-3-martial-arts-styles-and-spell-you-are-waiting-for?p=816408#post816408\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't think that's inconsistent at all, if there are styles designed to be used with elementally-aspected Essence, which are in fact <i>optimized </i>for use by that kind of Exalt.<br /> <br /> I also don't understand why it's so horrible that in one tiny little area, DBs might be better at a lousy five MA styles <i>in toto</i>, the five styles, I might add, which might have helped facilitate their overthrow of the Solars to begin with? That's hardly damaging the overall Solar niche.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think it damages anyone's niche or the consistency of the setting. Actually, it'd be nice if DBs could match Solars at the immaculate styles.<br /> <br /> But I have a hard time imagining how it could be balanced to give DBs a small set of Solar-level Charms or Solars a small set of DB-level Charms. Seems like immaculate MA would become either the One True Build for DBs or the One False Build for Solars. Or both.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/797631-why-craft-sucks-how-i-fixed-it\" target=\"_blank\">EX3 Craft Rewrite</a><br /> <br /> Sanctaphrax is not a person<br /> -Chejop Kejak","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1154-sanctaphrax","name":"Sanctaphrax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1154_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-25T14:50:02-08:00","id":816441,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sanctaphrax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/814854-top-3-martial-arts-styles-and-spell-you-are-waiting-for?p=816440#post816440\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't think it damages anyone's niche or the consistency of the setting. Actually, it'd be nice if DBs could match Solars at the immaculate styles.<br /> <br /> But I have a hard time imagining how it could be balanced to give DBs a small set of Solar-level Charms or Solars a small set of DB-level Charms. Seems like immaculate MA would become either the One True Build for DBs or the One False Build for Solars. Or both.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's already been stated (though this was a while ago, so may not be the current design strategy) that DBs would have some effects that would seem to be &quot;Solar-level&quot; (for as much use as that term is, which is to say little, but I can't think of anything better), except those effects would be more narrow in applicability, and would be there to showcase thematic high competency of DBs in those niches.<br /> <br /> Like, it would shock people for DBs to be as good as Solars at anything, and important to show that sometimes, they can hit that &quot;level,&quot; at least in a very focused way (versus Solars being on top and hitting those competencies in a very general way).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Chicanery-No: If a player uses this Charm in an abusive or exploitative manner, the ST may punch him right in the goddamn face.&quot; --TheDementedOne<br /> <br /> &quot;Happiness is <i>very</i> brittle and short-lived in the Exalted community, because <i>ressentiment</i> is our cultural touchstone.&quot; --Gayo","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3420-zelbinnean","name":"Zelbinnean","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5884"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-25T14:56:44-08:00","id":816444,"title":"","content":"Thing is, a martial arts style is a complete style of fighting. If it's the same for Solars and DBs, then a Dawn Fire Dragon master is little stronger than a Fire Aspect Fire Dragon master. A few Charms here and there being equal is no problem. But your whole combat suite, minus excellencies?<br /> <br /> Phoenix Flies On Golden Wings works the same way for everyone. But Righteous Devil Style doesn't.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/797631-why-craft-sucks-how-i-fixed-it\" target=\"_blank\">EX3 Craft Rewrite</a><br /> <br /> Sanctaphrax is not a person<br /> -Chejop Kejak","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1154-sanctaphrax","name":"Sanctaphrax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1154_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-25T16:11:21-08:00","id":816489,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sanctaphrax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/814854-top-3-martial-arts-styles-and-spell-you-are-waiting-for?p=816444#post816444\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thing is, a martial arts style is a complete style of fighting. If it's the same for Solars and DBs, then a Dawn Fire Dragon master is little stronger than a Fire Aspect Fire Dragon master. A few Charms here and there being equal is no problem. But your whole combat suite, minus excellencies?<br /> <br /> Phoenix Flies On Golden Wings works the same way for everyone. But Righteous Devil Style doesn't.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah pretty much. Also I think that the times that DB charms might seem to be &quot;Solar Level&quot; in power might be just for things that Solar charms can't do, like Ramparts of Obedient Earth. It's not like they're going to get Fire and Stones Strike, but the first dice purchased is free or something. Fire Dragon should be as good for Solars as Single Point is, so either they're better at Fire Dragon than Fire Aspects, or Fire Aspects have access to, essentially, a Solar charmset. Which kind of makes you feel like a chump if you go for DB melee, and also would just be straight up too powerful for an effect that Fire Aspects use.<br /> <br /> It really wouldn't even make that much sense to let them use the Lunar version, because then you have the same, albeit lesser, problem. On the other hand if it was kind of on the lower scale of Lunar power anyway and DBs had to be high essence with lots of expenditure to get it, then it would be a lot easier to balance out.<br /> <br /> The only time it would really come up as weird is in a mirror match between a DB Fire Dragon master and a Solar Fire Dragon master, where the Solar would be better at breathing fire and igniting a bonfire under their opponent than the Fire Aspect is.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-25T16:21:10-08:00","id":816494,"title":"","content":"I personally am waiting for Mantis Style, The Eye of Heaven style, and the Temperance style from the Imperfect Lotus for spells I think Ice Hornet is going to be fun as currently our attack spells are all aoe attacks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1635-citadel97501","name":"Citadel97501","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"544"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-25T17:13:36-08:00","id":816516,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Citadel97501</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/814854-top-3-martial-arts-styles-and-spell-you-are-waiting-for?p=816494#post816494\" rel=\"nofol